<title>ISRAEL: Zim Israel Navigation moves to fixed-day service.</title>
<headline>Zim Israel Navigation moves to fixed-day service.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zim Israel Navigation said on Thursday its container service would move next month to a fixed-day weekly schedule in all its ports of call.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said Zim Container Service would deploy eight new vessels, bringing to 15 number of ships it operates with 3,000 to 3,400 TEU capacity each.</p>
<p>Service will begin in mid-March in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
